## What Shipped

Added adversarial tournament between Phase 2.5C (Pattern Matching) and Phase 4 (Vision Gate + Synthesis). Opportunities extracted from evidence vault + pattern matcher compete head-to-head in LLM-judged debates, accumulate Elo scores, and get diversity-enforced before synthesis.

**Architecture:** Prompt protocol (markdown) + lightweight Python Elo scorer. Follows same pattern as evidence-vault-protocol.md and reasoning-chain-protocol.md. The LLM IS the orchestrator — no heavy Python orchestration.

